{"id":"7f65c348d236e554","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-turing-reducible.md","title":"Turing Reducibility","display":"df-turing-reducible — Turing Reducibility","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-turing-reducible","aliases":["58-df-turing-reducible"],"display":"df-turing-reducible — Turing Reducibility","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-turing-reducible"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-turing-reducible</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-turing-reducible — Turing Reducibility"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1d725a0797bae6df\" href=\"?note=1d725a0797bae6df\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\subseteq \\omega\">\\(A \\subseteq \\omega\\)</span> (子集/语言)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B \\subseteq \\omega\">\\(B \\subseteq \\omega\\)</span> (子集/Oracle)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,x,y\\in\\omega\">\\(e,x,y\\in\\omega\\)</span> (图灵泛函编号、输入与输出)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2OracleComputation}_S(y,e,B,x)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2OracleComputation}_S(y,e,B,x)\\)</span> (Oracle 计算值谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1d725a0797bae6df\" href=\"?note=1d725a0797bae6df\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}reducible}\\vdash\nA\\leq_T B\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\exists e\\in\\omega\\;\\forall x\\in\\omega\\;\n\\exists y\\in\\{0,1\\}\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2OracleComputation}_S(y,e,B,x)\n\\land(y=1\\leftrightarrow x\\in A)\\right)\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}reducible}\\vdash\nA\\leq_T B\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\exists e\\in\\omega\\;\\forall x\\in\\omega\\;\n\\exists y\\in\\{0,1\\}\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2OracleComputation}_S(y,e,B,x)\n\\land(y=1\\leftrightarrow x\\in A)\\right)\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\leq_T B\">\\(A \\leq_T B\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 可由带 Oracle <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的图灵机判定</li>\n<li>总性与输出值由每个输入都存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(y\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 保证；运行语义复用 Oracle-computation 图，而不是仅在 Turing-machine 备注中出现的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^B(x)\\downarrow\">\\(\\Phi_e^B(x)\\downarrow\\)</span> 记号。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_T\">\\(\\equiv_T\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_T\">\\(&lt;_T\\)</span> 是由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_T\">\\(\\leq_T\\)</span> 派生的独立定义，不再在本 assertion 中重复定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_T\">\\(\\leq_T\\)</span> 是自反的、传递的，但对称性由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_T\">\\(\\equiv_T\\)</span> 给出</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"af73296236e5df83\" href=\"?note=af73296236e5df83\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md\">../batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md</a> — Turing 机</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"227c7eaf354f0ec0\" href=\"?note=227c7eaf354f0ec0\" title=\"58-df-turing-degree\">58-df-turing-degree</a> — Turing 度</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"da0bcf2e3f060472\" href=\"?note=da0bcf2e3f060472\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-recursive.md\">../batch07/58-df-recursive.md</a> — 递归函数</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Related-Concepts","text":"[Related Concepts]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation.md","status":"resolved","id":"1d725a0797bae6df","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation.md","status":"resolved","id":"1d725a0797bae6df","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2OracleComputation}_S(y,e,B,x)$ (Oracle 计算值谓词, see [[../batch03/58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md","status":"resolved","id":"af73296236e5df83","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Related Concepts]","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md]] — Turing 机","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-turing-degree","status":"resolved","id":"227c7eaf354f0ec0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Related Concepts]","excerpt":"[[58-df-turing-degree]] — Turing 度","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-recursive.md","status":"resolved","id":"da0bcf2e3f060472","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Related Concepts]","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-recursive.md]] — 递归函数","embed":false}],"math"